<title>USA: Unimed CEO Simes resigns.</title>
<headline>Unimed CEO Simes resigns.</headline>
<dateline>BUFFALO GROVE, Ill. 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unimed Pharmaceuticals Inc said Monday president and chief executive officer Stephen Simes resigned to pursue other business interests.  </p>
<p>Dr. Robert Dudley, vice president of clinical and regulatory affairs, was appointed interim president and CEO of the company, which develops and markets niche pharmaceutical products for AIDS, endocrinology and urology therapeutic areas.</p>
<p>A company spokesman was not available for further comment.</p>
<p>Unimed shares were down 3/8 at 7-1/2 Monday.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
